er-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hop_%27N%27_Shop\" title=\"Hop &#39;N&#39; Shop\">Hop 'N' Shop</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>17</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Hold 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Scattered_Eggs\" title=\"Scattered Eggs\">Scattered Eggs</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.5.0\" title=\"Version 1.5.0\">v1.5.0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><big>\"<b>Collect those eggs in style! Use this basket to hold up to 10 eggs!</b>\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"><b>Description</b></span></h2>\n<p><b>Easter basket</b> was available for <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>17 during the Easter Event. It was used to collect 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Scattered_Eggs\" title=\"Scattered Eggs\">Scattered Eggs</a> at once.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\"><b>History</b></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Was added in <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.5.0\" title=\"Version 1.5.0\">Version 1.5.0</a>, on the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>;</li>\n<li>On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals\" title=\"Eggcelent Deals\">Eggtastic Hop Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>The mechanics have been completely redesigned;\n<ul><li>The <b>Easter basket</b> can now collect 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Scattered_Eggs\" title=\"Scattered Eggs\">Scattered Eggs</a> at once instead of doubling the <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">Eggs</a>;</li></ul></li>\n<li>On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals\" title=\"Eggcelent Deals\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <span class=\"new\" title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, the price has been changed from <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>125 to $1,600;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>, it was sold at <a href=\"/wiki/Hop_%27N%27_Shop\" title=\"Hop &#39;N&#39; Shop\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Easter_event\" title=\"2025 Easter event\">2025 Easter event</a>, the price has been changed from $1,600 to <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">🥚</a>17.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163156\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 51/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019496/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.687      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   32.687      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1508-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163156 and revision id 21263. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Limited","Event_Items"],"links":[{"title":"Eggs","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay","exists":true},{"title":"Hop 'N' Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Scattered Eggs","exists":true},{"title":"Version 1.5.0","exists":true},{"title":"2025 Easter event","exists":true},{"title":"Eggcelent Deals","exists":true},{"title":"2023 Easter event","exists":false},{"title":"2024 Easter event","exists":false}],"images":["Easter_Basket.png"]}
